   "text": "Trade-offs to raise\n\u2022 At-least-once + idempotent consumer\n\u2022 Partition key sets ordering + hot partitions\n\u2022 Back pressure: consumer lag alarms\n\u2022 Replay from offset after a bug\n\u2022 DLQ: who drains it?",
